Operation <=Fortress=>

[en.EVENT_C01_MAIN_22_desc]
According to an unverifiable secret message... Emm... rumor, the Empire Ministry of Order organized a large-scale arrest operation in the forbidden jungle yesterday, however encountered an ambush and all imperial troops were annihilated.
Again, this is a rumor, do not believe it.

